 "notes": [
  "All messages on MIDI channel 1. Buttons: note on 127, release note on 0. Faders and knobs: absolute 0-127.",
  "Jog wheels, the browse knob and the six effect-row encoders send relative ticks: 1..3 clockwise, 127..125 counter-clockwise.",
  "MASTER GAIN, MIC GAIN and MIC THROUGH are analog only and send nothing. Cue gain and Cue mix do send.",
  "Holding SCRATCH on a deck is that deck's shift: the EQ knobs become zoom / rotate / crop, the jog scrubs, the hot cues are kaleidoscope presets.",
  "Roles: do = param (absolute, soft takeover) | relative (ticks) | seek | cmd | toggle | momentary | step | set | reset | master | master-momentary | browse | load | nexttab | shift | none."
 ],
